From: cdiogo1979 <cdiogo@gmail.com>
Date: Tue, 10 Nov 2026 10:39:13 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Declare DAGs in workflows/*.json; the platform builds them

The lakehouse platform's lakehouse_dags factory now builds this repository's
Airflow DAGs from workflows/*.json. The repository keeps its code (notebooks/),
its settings (configs/), and a fixed two-line stub in dags/.

- Add workflows/test_environment.json (same DAG and task IDs as before) and the
  dags/lakehouse.py stub.
- Remove dags/dag_factory.py, dag_defaults.py, spark_output.py, .airflowignore,
  and test_environment.py, now owned by the platform.
- notebooks/common/cli.py: workflow task arguments after "--" (task_args).
- Remove the dev-bundle client and its examples; the platform has no dev bundle.
- Jenkinsfile: validate workflows with lakehouse-validate-workflows.
- README.md is the complete guide; AIRFLOW_BUNDLES.md removed; AGENTS.md updated.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
